{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2022-12-05 19:00:00', 'title': 'ANSYS ANNOUNCES GLOBALFOUNDRIES CERTIFICATION OF SEMICONDUCTOR TOOLS FOR GF 22FDX® PLATFORM', 'text': "FOUNDRY CERTIFICATION ENABLES GF 22FDX CUSTOMERS TO VALIDATE THEIR CHIP DESIGNS' POWER INTEGRITY AND RELIABILITY WITH ANSYS GOLDEN SIGNOFF TOOLS / KEY HIGHLIGHTS ANSYS® REDHAWK-SC™, ANSYS® RAPTORH™ AND ANSYS® HFSS™ CERTIFIED AS SIGNOFF SOLUTIONS FOR GF'S FLAGSHIP 22FDX PLATFORM CHIP DESIGNERS RELY ON THE PREDICTIVE ACCURACY OF ANSYS' INDUSTRY-LEADING SIGNOFF TOOLS TO REDUCE THE COST AND INCREASE THE PERFORMANCE OF THEIR 22FDX DESIGNS WITH CONFIDENCE PITTSBURGH , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ANSYS\xa0(NASDAQ: ANSS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GF HAS CERTIFIED ANSYS® REDHAWK-SC™, ANSYS® RAPTORH™ AND ANSYS® HFSS™ SEMICONDUCTOR TOOLS\xa0FOR ITS FLAGSHIP 22FDX PLATFORM. THE GF CERTIFICATION ENABLES CHIP DESIGNERS TO REDUCE COSTS BY ELIMINATING WASTEFUL SAFETY MARGINS AND IMPROVING SYSTEM PERFORMANCE, WITHOUT COMPROMISING RELIABILITY OR RISKING UNEXPECTED AND DAMAGING INTERACTIONS BETWEEN DESIGN ELEMENTS."}